# Generated slide images (rebuilt by docs/presentation/build_deck.py)

# Build tooling, not coursework. These scripts generate the committed
# deliverables (the .pptx deck, its speaking script, and the figures under
# docs/assets/). The deliverables are versioned; the machinery that produces
# them is local, and stays out of the published repository.
